  "explanation": {
    "md_es": [
      "**in** (dentro) · **on** (encima, en contacto) · **under** (debajo) · **next to** (al lado de) · **behind** (detrás de) · **in front of** (delante de) · **between** (entre dos cosas)",
      "",
      "**Pregunta:** *Where's my phone?* (= Where is) · *Where are my keys?*",
      "",
      "Cuidado: *on the table* (sobre la mesa, no *in the table*) y *next to* lleva **to**."
    ],
    "common_mistakes_es": [
      {
        "wrong": "in the table",
        "right": "on the table",
        "note": "Sobre una superficie se usa 'on'."
      },
      {
        "wrong": "next the lamp / in front the sofa",
        "right": "next to the lamp / in front of the sofa",
        "note": "No olvides 'to' ni 'of'."
      }
    ],
    "false_friends": []
  },
